  "content": "\n\n<h2>关于</h2>\n<h1>Kaleidoscope End Refabricated</h1>\n<h1>森罗物语：末地-重织</h1>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>一款为《森罗烹饪》增添末地内容扩展的 Minecraft 模组。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>模组详情</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkaleidoscope-end\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Kaleidoscope End</strong></a> 模组的 <strong>Fabric 移植版</strong>。</li>\n<li>需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkaleidoscope-cookery-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Kaleidoscope Cookery Refabricated</strong></a> 作为前置依赖。</li>\n<li>抱歉，暂无旧版本兼容（Backport）计划。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>概览</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-Java Edition-brightgreen\" alt=\"Minecraft\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric- 1.21.1| 1.21.11| 26.2.1| 26.2-orange\" alt=\"Fabric\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue\" alt=\"License\"><br>\n末地也需要美味佳肴！本模组为《森罗厨房》带来了与末地相关的扩展内容。</p>\n<p>你可以在末地发现两种新作物：梦莓（Dream Berries）与末地薄荷（Ender Mint）。</p>\n<h3>🍽️ 丰富料理</h3>\n<p>龙系料理：包含龙息紫颂汤、熟末影龙肉、煎龙蛋等；</p>\n<p>潜影贝料理：例如酿馅潜影贝、潜影贝冰淇淋；</p>\n<p>紫颂果系列：紫颂意面、紫颂花茶、紫颂蛋糕。</p>\n<p>以及……胖乎乎的末地幼虫。</p>\n<h3>✨ 新效果与机制</h3>\n<p>食用龙蛋料理将带来独特的新效果……</p>\n<p>可疑的龙蛋……？</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/53efdeace61fd8654eda31d662e865baf0c350cd_0.webp\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<h3>原作者授权许可</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc1569f57486a71b75749ac0207c9261119a364f.png\" alt=\"Permission\"></p>",
